  "body": "Bumps the website-dependencies group with 1 update in the / directory: [@astrojs/mdx](https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/mdx).\n\nUpdates `@astrojs/mdx` from 7.0.3 to 7.0.7\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/releases\">@​astrojs/mdx's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><code>@​astrojs/mdx</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.0.7</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17731\">#17731</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/bc171af0e29a1bb4ca56beffde1c4c03e1bb227f\"><code>bc171af</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/Princesseuh\"><code>@​Princesseuh</code></a>! - Updates Sätteri processor to v0.10.3. See <a href=\"https://github.com/bruits/satteri/blob/main/packages/satteri/CHANGELOG.md#0103--2026-08-19\">its changelog</a> for details on bugs fixed and features added.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Updated dependencies [<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/05763a0884aabb1da78a2749d5bb9d41ae620527\"><code>05763a0</code></a>]:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/internal-helpers</code><a href=\"https://github.com/0\"><code>@​0</code></a>.10.4</li>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.2.4</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​astrojs/mdx</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.0.6</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies [<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/8c193f67cce77cf2e41fb702c88ca46f788f1277\"><code>8c193f6</code></a>]:\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/internal-helpers</code><a href=\"https://github.com/0\"><code>@​0</code></a>.10.3</li>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.2.3</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​astrojs/mdx</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.0.5</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies [<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/c895b12b99a73f5a9f98d6699452d12c138f8a18\"><code>c895b12</code></a>]:\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/internal-helpers</code><a href=\"https://github.com/0\"><code>@​0</code></a>.10.2</li>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.2.2</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​astrojs/mdx</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.0.4</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17514\">#17514</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/41a00dd86fc848763fa9dc6e501d6e85188c1306\"><code>41a00dd</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/gtritchie\"><code>@​gtritchie</code></a>! - Fixes a bug where the integration was emitting React-cased attribute names.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/blob/main/packages/integrations/mdx/CHANGELOG.md\">@​astrojs/mdx's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>7.0.7</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17731\">#17731</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/bc171af0e29a1bb4ca56beffde1c4c03e1bb227f\"><code>bc171af</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/Princesseuh\"><code>@​Princesseuh</code></a>! - Updates Sätteri processor to v0.10.3. See <a href=\"https://github.com/bruits/satteri/blob/main/packages/satteri/CHANGELOG.md#0103--2026-08-19\">its changelog</a> for details on bugs fixed and features added.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Updated dependencies [<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/05763a0884aabb1da78a2749d5bb9d41ae620527\"><code>05763a0</code></a>]:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/internal-helpers</code><a href=\"https://github.com/0\"><code>@​0</code></a>.10.4</li>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.2.4</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.0.6</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies [<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/8c193f67cce77cf2e41fb702c88ca46f788f1277\"><code>8c193f6</code></a>]:\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/internal-helpers</code><a href=\"https://github.com/0\"><code>@​0</code></a>.10.3</li>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.2.3</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.0.5</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated dependencies [<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/c895b12b99a73f5a9f98d6699452d12c138f8a18\"><code>c895b12</code></a>]:\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/internal-helpers</code><a href=\"https://github.com/0\"><code>@​0</code></a>.10.2</li>\n<li><code>@​astrojs/markdown-remark</code><a href=\"https://github.com/7\"><code>@​7</code></a>.2.2</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>7.0.4</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/withastro/astro/pull/17514\">#17514</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/41a00dd86fc848763fa9dc6e501d6e85188c1306\"><code>41a00dd</code></a> Thanks <a href=\"https://github.com/gtritchie\"><code>@​gtritchie</code></a>! - Fixes a bug where the integration was emitting React-cased attribute names.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/8a31cba625a23d886614172e1d3b02b8eb896a18\"><code>8a31cba</code></a> [ci] release (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/mdx/issues/17739\">#17739</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/bc171af0e29a1bb4ca56beffde1c4c03e1bb227f\"><code>bc171af</code></a> feat(satteri): update to Sätteri 0.10.x (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/mdx/issues/17731\">#17731</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/52e6c34790cc8ac4e69e6135ace06049867e5c4a\"><code>52e6c34</code></a> [ci] release (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/mdx/issues/17691\">#17691</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/b0535ca0a98846b46a3ab16c52c4d6adda7cfa10\"><code>b0535ca</code></a> [ci] release (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/mdx/issues/17528\">#17528</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/112d3ea14cf997218239fd8a436707e56a3815fb\"><code>112d3ea</code></a> [ci] release (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/mdx/issues/17469\">#17469</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commit/41a00dd86fc848763fa9dc6e501d6e85188c1306\"><code>41a00dd</code></a> fix(mdx): emit HTML attribute casing on the Sätteri MDX path (<a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/tree/HEAD/packages/integrations/mdx/issues/17514\">#17514</a>)</li>\n<li>See full diff in <a href=\"https://github.com/withastro/astro/commits/@astrojs/mdx@7.0.7/packages/integrations/mdx\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n",
